      "summary": {
        "en": "Makes a single ally become \"Shifu.\" When using Basic ATK or dealing Enhanced Basic ATK's DMG, triggers the corresponding effect based on the \"Shifu\"'s Path:\nErudition, Destruction, The Hunt, Remembrance, Elation: Deals Additional DMG based on Shifu's Type.\nHarmony, Nihility, Preservation, Abundance: Toughness Reduction increases.",
        "zh-CN": "使我方单体成为【师父】。施放普攻或造成强化普攻的伤害时，根据【师父】命途触发对应效果：\n「智识」、「毁灭」、「巡猎」、「记忆」、「欢愉」：额外造成基于【师父】属性的附加伤害。\n「同谐」、「虚无」、「存护」、「丰饶」：削韧值提高。"
